WEBVTT

00:09:26.937 --> 00:09:30.399
and you would practice hucking up
half-court shots.

00:09:30.441 --> 00:09:34.111
Well, you're probably
never going to be on Jeopardy.

00:09:34.695 --> 00:09:37.531
You are probably never
going to take a half-court shot

00:09:37.531 --> 00:09:38.699
at an NBA game

00:09:38.741 --> 00:09:40.451
for a chance to win 50,000 dollars.

00:09:40.492 --> 00:09:43.954
But you will, I guarantee it,

00:09:43.996 --> 00:09:45.164
at some point,

00:09:45.164 --> 00:09:47.916
become embroiled in a complicated,

00:09:47.958 --> 00:09:51.920
confusing, ugly,
gut-wrenching moral dilemma.

00:09:51.962 --> 00:09:55.633
That is just a fact of life on Earth.

00:09:56.091 --> 00:09:59.928
There will be a dilemma
in which there is no clear rule to follow.